# The UI pages checked against fixtures in a real Chromium (the ui-fixtures job of ci.yml, and
# `node tools/ui-fixtures-run.js` here). One page per line:
#   <script in tools/>  <its screenshot folder>  [runner]
# Each runs as `node tools/<script> <repo> <shots>/<folder>`. A page with a runner number always
# runs on that runner and starts first there: these are the pages that take a minute or more,
# spread over the three runners by their measured times (#791) so that the runners finish at
# about the same time. The others go round robin in the order of this list. A new page goes at
# the end; give it a runner number only if it takes a minute or more.

